          "snippet": {
            "line": 501,
            "text": "theorem jet_regularInverse_succ (I : Window) {ε : ℝ} (hε : 0 < ε) (r : ℕ) (hr : 1 ≤ r)\n    (A : AxisSpace I ε) (n m : ℕ) {x : ℝ} (hx : x ∈ I.interval) :\n    inputJet I ε (regularInverse I hε r hr A) (n + 1) m x =\n      inputJet I ε A n m x / radialDivisor r n"
          }
